The code in this directory (mini_swe_agent_v2/, and the parts of agent.py and harbor_env.py that
follow the original adapter and Docker environment) comes from CooperBench
(https://github.com/cooperbench/CooperBench, commit 63b9d44d9f39a02fccf5bf0052db48a917a011fd,
MIT license), which itself adapts mini-swe-agent (https://github.com/SWE-agent/mini-swe-agent,
MIT license, Copyright (c) 2025 Kilian A. Lieret and Carlos E. Jimenez). Changes here: import
paths, an injectable Redis client in MessagingConnector, and the connectors package exporting only
the two connectors used.

